// Three pipelines, run against the REAL engines:
//   A. transmute()      — the 5-section DNA format (what Transmuter/Forge produce)
//   B. buildClassicWasm — the 14 "classic" WASMs Forge regenerates
//   C. buildJar()       — the Jar Optimizer pack format
